<title>USA: U.S. oats trade -- Commerce.</title>
<headline>U.S. oats trade -- Commerce.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department</p>
<p>report of U.S. trade in raw oats, in tonnes:</p>
<p> -	   Exports   Imports</p>
<p> -  May 97   2,492   116,011</p>
<p> -  Apr 97   1,791   158,431</p>
<p> -  May 96   5,822    51,190</p>
<p>Note--Exports include oats and seed for sowing. Imports include seed, mixed feed oats and other oats. Exports and imports do not include grains worked of oats.</p>
</text>
